    "html": "<p><em>RYR1</em> encodes the ryanodine receptor isoform 1, a calcium channel. It plays a critical role in calcium release and muscle contraction in skeletal muscle and is the primary locus for malignant hyperthermia susceptibility, a pharmacogenetic condition.</p>\n"
